# `STATECHART-GENRE-SCOPE`: the language number moved for the first time, and this
# fixture pins the half of core §13.0 that the move is CONSTRAINED by: `Y`
# adds and never removes, so every genre and every construct legal under
# `figdown 0.1` is legal under `figdown 0.2`, unchanged and with the same
# model. The only field that differs is `header.version`, which the model now
# carries as DECLARED rather than as a constant of the projection.
figdown 0.2 block
node a "A"
node b "B"
edge a -> b
